@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-commencement`

-- ind-a-tests-commencement.l4: ind-a's commencement scenarios (C-01 to C-07 of work/ind-a/expectations.md),
-- decided before the encoding was opened.  Commencement is G7's, outside ind-a's groups; these are run against
-- G7's exported functions as a cross-check because ind-a's Second Schedule column C and every s.3 to s.18 rule
-- take the commencement day or "the Law has commenced" as an input.

§ `ind-a commencement fixtures`

-- The gazette's facts: the Law published 2025-01-14; the Fees Regulations (s.59) in force 2025-07-16; no s.46 regulations.
`ind-a gazette facts` MEANS
    `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63` WITH
        `the day the Law was published in Reshumot` IS YMD 2025 1 14
        `the s.59 regulations came into force on` IS YMD 2025 7 16
        `the day regulations under section 46 came into force, if any` IS NOTHING

-- C-02 counterfactual: the s.59 regulations in force on 2025-03-01, before three months from publication.
`ind-a early regulations` MEANS
    `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63` WITH
        `the day the Law was published in Reshumot` IS YMD 2025 1 14
        `the s.59 regulations came into force on` IS YMD 2025 3 1
        `the day regulations under section 46 came into force, if any` IS NOTHING

GIVEN designation IS A STRING
      permitted IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Cooling system`
`ind-a system using` designation permitted MEANS
    `Cooling system` WITH
        `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 7
        `refrigerants` IS LIST (Refrigerant WITH `designation` IS designation, `use of the refrigerant is permitted by law` IS permitted)

§ `s.63(a)`

-- C-01
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` `ind-a gazette facts` EQUALS YMD 2025 7 16
-- C-02
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` `ind-a early regulations` EQUALS YMD 2025 4 14
-- C-03, C-04: R-32 (Fourth Schedule item 20), use permitted.
#ASSERT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "32" TRUE) `on the day` (YMD 2025 7 16) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "32" TRUE) `on the day` (YMD 2025 7 15) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
-- C-05, C-06: R-410A (not in the Fourth Schedule): 18 months after 2025-07-16.
#ASSERT `the day the Law commences for a system with any other refrigerant under section 63(a)(2)` `ind-a gazette facts` EQUALS YMD 2027 1 16
#ASSERT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "410A" TRUE) `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 16) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "410A" TRUE) `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 15) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
-- C-07: a listed flammable refrigerant whose use is not permitted falls under paragraph (2).
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "32" FALSE) `on the day` (YMD 2026 1 1) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
#ASSERT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-a system using` "32" FALSE) `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 16) `given the facts` `ind-a gazette facts`
